<title>HONG KONG: China Eastern debuts at HK$1.50 per shr.</title>
<headline>China Eastern debuts at HK$1.50 per shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in China Eastern Airlines Corp Ltd started trading in Hong Kong on Wednesday at HK$1.50 per share compared with an issue price of HK$1.38.</p>
</text>
